<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae launches Inparsa.</title>
<headline>Sonae launches Inparsa.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese industrial group Sonae Investimentos said it has formed a separate holding company, Inparsa-Industria e Participacoes SGPS, as part of a previously announced restructuring.</p>
<p>Inparsa holds stakes that were previously held by Sonae Investimentos in wood products subsidiary Sonae Industria and services group Pargeste.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
